    "detailed_description": "Scare: Fatal Picture is a survival horror game in which you must face a dangerous ghost tribe to save your sister.<br><br><strong>Synopsis:</strong><br>Your sister was kidnapped by a dangerous ghost tribe, to be killed and eaten by the queen.<br>You control Madoka, the older sister. Your goal is to find the tribe's hiding place and<br>save Sasuke, your younger sister.<br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>In a first-person perspective, you will face a ghost tribe.<br>Your weapon is your camera, you must use it to destroy your enemies by taking pictures of them.<br>In addition, you will be able to use your Camera to illuminate areas and destroy objects,<br>like masks, dolls, and seals to unlock doors.",
